              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Virtual Nursing</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Allow more time to focus on hands-on patient care</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Your licensed virtual nurses work from the virtual command center, interacting with patients directly via a screen in the patient’s room and supporting a curated task list.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
