          "topMargin": "3",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Help reduce documentation for bedside staff<sup>1</sup></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Research studies have estimated how much of a shift nurses spend on documentation. One U.S. study shows how task delegation and tech enablement including virtual nursing, virtual monitoring and ambient monitoring can help nurses reclaim time.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Nov 14 2025 21:49:05 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
