          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Nurses spend <b><span class=\"futura-bold\">15 to 25% of their shift</span></b> on documentation including charting and review<sup>1,2</sup></span></p>\n",
